# Raw Kaggle Olympics source data is large (~45MB) and publicly
# re-downloadable; keep the repo lean and commit only the cleaned,
# chart-ready CSVs. The World Bank reference files are small and are the
# actual cited source for the report, so those ARE committed.
data/raw/*.csv
data/raw/*.pkl
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/wb_gdp_raw.csv
!data/raw/wb_population_raw.csv
!data/raw/flfp_ref.csv

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
